msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/stageImplFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "stageImpl is functional"
msgstr "stageImpl 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/stageImplFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:stageImpl is functional: each gmeow:PipelineStage binds to exactly one Rust Stage implementation in the STAGE_REGISTRY and the loader hard-fails when the key resolves to no implementation, so a stage carries a single registry-key value."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:stageImpl 是函数性的:每个 gmeow:PipelineStage 恰好绑定到 STAGE_REGISTRY 中的一个 Rust Stage 实现,当该键无法解析出任何实现时加载器将硬性失败,因此一个阶段只携带一个注册表键值。"
